# Binary data files
*.feather
# The only tracked feathers are the graded truth files named in
# test/telemetry_benchmark_manifest.toml (plus the two Odyssey mission-record
# alt files kept beside the kernel ones for reference). Anything else must be
# fetched, not committed; ci_tracked_feather_registry_gate enforces it.
